# 4. Characteristics of Data

| Characteristic | Meaning                |
| -------------- | ---------------------- |
| Accuracy       | Correct data           |
| Completeness   | No missing values      |
| Consistency    | Same format everywhere |
| Timeliness     | Updated data           |
| Relevance      | Useful data            |
| Reliability    | Trusted source         |
| Validity       | Follows rules          |
| Uniqueness     | No duplicate records   |
| Accessibility  | Easy access            |
| Security       | Protected data         |

---

## Important Characteristics

### Accuracy

Correct and error-free data.

Example:

```text
Marks = 90
```

---

### Completeness

No important value should be missing.

Example:

```text
Marks = NULL
```

---

### Consistency

Same format everywhere.

Example:

```text
14/05/2026
May 14, 2026
```

---

### Timeliness

Latest and updated data.

---

### Validity

Data should follow rules.

Example:

```text
Age = -5
```

Invalid value.

