# 8. Data Analytics Lifecycle (DALC)

## Phases of DALC

```text
Discovery
    ↓
Data Preparation
    ↓
Model Planning
    ↓
Model Building
    ↓
Communicate Results
    ↓
Operationalize
```

---

## 1. Discovery

Problem identify karna.

Example:
Sales decrease hone ka reason find karna.

---

## 2. Data Preparation

Data cleaning and organization.

Example:
Missing values remove karna.

---

## 3. Model Planning

Techniques and algorithms choose karna.

Example:
Regression model select karna.

---

## 4. Model Building

Model train aur test karna.

Example:
Python me ML model banana.

---

## 5. Communicate Results

Reports aur charts create karna.

---

## 6. Operationalize

Model deployment and monitoring.

Example:
Fraud detection system deploy karna.

